  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I<br />\t\t\tPolymers</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong><br />\t\t\t<strong>Commenrcial names</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>Phenol-formaldehyde resin</td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td>Glyptal</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>Copolymer of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></math>-butadiene and styrene</td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td>Novolac</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>Polyester of glycol and phthalic acid</td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td>Buna-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>Polyester of glycol&nbsp;and terephthalic acid</td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td>Dacron</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
